   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Hardware and Software Tool Management </h2>",
   "body": "<p>With ZOLLER Smart Cabinets, you’ll always have grinding wheels and grinding wheel packs quickly at your fingertips. Each wheel is put into storage securely and can be located quickly. </p> <p>With the support of the ZOLLER Tool Management Solutions software, you gain full transparency into your stock. You always know which wheels are currently in use on which machine and can see a package’s storage location and tool data at a glance. </p> <p>Learn more about ZOLLER Tool Management</p>",
